{
  "slug": "shopify-skills",
  "name": "Shopify Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Chompute Shopify Skills gives Claude a single package of Shopify operations skills for store analysis, reporting, exports, product copy, discounts, inventory workflows, segmentation, SEO review, and marketing drafts. It is designed as a preview-first Shopify operations bundle: Claude can generate reports, drafts, previews, and exports, and should ask for approval before applying write actions.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **28 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (28): `chompute-shopify-announcement-bar` (Generate on-brand announcement-bar copy variants for a Shopify store with a preview HTML snippet styled to the store's…), `chompute-shopify-blog-writer` (Generate an SEO blog post HTML for a Shopify store with optional automatic product links embedded in the…), `chompute-shopify-broken-links-report` (Audit every URL redirect on a Shopify store via the Admin API and flag the ones whose target…), `chompute-shopify-cart-recovery` (Generate a branded abandoned-cart recovery email template + pull the most recent abandoned checkouts so the merchant can…), `chompute-shopify-collection-builder` (Analyze a Shopify catalog + sales history and propose smart-collection rules (bestsellers, new arrivals, by tag/type/vendor, price band,…), `chompute-shopify-cross-sell-recommender` (Analyze recent Shopify orders to find products that are frequently bought together, preview cross-sell recommendations, and optionally save…), `chompute-shopify-customer-exporter` (Export all data held about a specific Shopify customer into a downloadable JSON file or zipped CSV export…), `chompute-shopify-customer-ltv` (Calculate Shopify customer lifetime value (LTV/CLV), show customer groups based on the month of first order, and optionally…), and 20 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install shopify-skills@claude-community` from `dragonfruit-ai/skills` (`plugins/shopify-skills`).",
  "compatibility": [
